(8, 2, '2021-03-24', '张国钦', 'C', '搜尋頻次4000萬！熱門話題TOP1的抗衰老保養方法，能拯救衰老肌膚、改善皺紋鬆弛的竟是...........', 'https://licat.work/storage/topic/20210327/ee2a19f1d3667f3fbf083840d5ea962c.', 'Lisa', 1, '<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang="en">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset="UTF-8">\n    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">\n    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">\n    <title>搜尋頻次4000萬！熱門話題TOP1的抗衰老保養方法，能拯救衰老肌膚、改善皺紋鬆弛的竟是...........</title>\n    <link rel="shortcut icon" href="https://storage.licat.work/favicon/woman.ico">\n    <script async src="https://storage.licat.work/v4/licat.min.js?update=2020.12.05"></script>\n\n    <style>\n        * {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            font-family: ''Arial Negreta'', ''Arial Normal'', ''Arial'';\n            max-width: 600px;\n        }\n\n        /* 头部区 */\n        .comm_header {\n            width: 100%\n        }\n\n        .top {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 35px;\n            padding-top: 5px;\n            background-color: #fff;\n            position: relative;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n        }\n\n        .top span {\n            width: 30px;\n            height: 30px;\n            float: left;\n            /* margin-left: 10px; */\n        }\n\n        .top p {\n            float: left;\n            font-family: 微軟儷黑體, 微軟正黑體, Arial, Helvetica, Microsoft JhengHei;\n            line-height: 27px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            font-weight: 900;\n        }\n\n        .top>div:nth-child(1)>span {\n            background: url(https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/917298378/O1CN01gFxglr2BlAtn42My9_!!917298378.png)0 -90px no-repeat;\n        }\n\n        /* 導航欄 */\n        .top .comm_header_list {\n            /* margin: auto 15px auto auto; */\n            /* margin: 15px 15px 0; */\n            margin-right: 5px;\n            display: block;\n            line-height: 40px;\n        }\n\n        .top .comm_header_list>ul {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            list-style: none;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            line-height: 45px;\n        }\n\n        .top .comm_header_list>ul>li {\n            float: left;\n            width: 25px;\n            height: 25px;\n            margin-left: 5px;\n            /* position: relative; */\n            padding: 0;\n            list-style: none;\n            display: list-item;\n            text-align: -webkit-match-parent\n        }\n\n        .top .comm_header_list>ul>li>img {\n            width: 100%;\n            border: 0\n        }\n\n        .comm_header_nav {\n            border-top: 1px solid #000000;\n            height: 45px;\n            width: 100%;\n            font-family: 微軟儷黑體, 微軟正黑體, Arial, Helvetica, Microsoft JhengHei\n        }\n\n        .comm_header_nav .comm_header_nav_menu {\n            background-color: #fff;\n            color: #000000;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            max-width: 800px\n        }\n\n        .comm_header_nav .comm_header_nav_menu>ul {\n            list-style-type: none;\n            display: -webkit-box;\n            display: -webkit-flex;\n            padding: 0;\n            overflow: auto;\n            margin: 0\n        }\n\n        .comm_header_nav .comm_header_nav_menu>ul>li {\n            font-size: 18px;\n            padding: 0 13px;\n            line-height: 45px;\n            white-space: nowrap;\n            position: relative;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            float: left;\n            list-style: none\n        }\n\n        .comm_header_nav .comm_header_nav_menu>ul .active {\n            color: #ffaaaf\n        }\n\n        /* 麵包屑 */\n        .label {\n            background-color: #EFEFEF;\n            height: 40px;\n            line-height: 40px;\n            padding-left: 10px;\n            font-family: 微軟儷黑體, 微軟正黑體, Arial, Helvetica, Microsoft JhengHei;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            font-size: 14px;\n        }\n\n        .label span {\n            width: 40px;\n            display: inline-block;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n\n        /* 標題 */\n        .comm_title {\n            width: 100%;\n            margin: 15px 0 10px;\n            text-align: justify\n        }\n\n        .comm_title>h1 {\n            padding: 0 15px;\n            font-family: ''Arial Negreta'', ''Arial Normal'', ''Arial'';\n            font-weight: 700;\n            font-style: normal;\n            font-size: 20px;\n            letter-spacing: 2px;\n            line-height: 40px;\n        }\n\n        .comm_status {\n            position: relative;\n            margin: 0 15px 20px\n        }\n\n        .comm_status .comm_time {\n            width: 50%;\n            font-size: 14px\n        }\n\n        .comm_status .comm_time>p {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            list-style: none\n        }\n\n        .comm_status .comm_time>p .color3 {\n            color: #ff9398\n        }\n\n        .comm_status .comm_time>p .color5 {\n            color: #9f9f9f\n        }\n\n        .comm_status .comm_time>p .l_icon::after {\n            content: "|";\n            margin: 0 6px;\n            color: #9f9f9f\n        }\n\n        .fixedmenu {\n            position: fixed;\n            display: none;\n            top: 0;\n            z-index: 9;\n            width: 100%\n        }\n\n        /* 内容区 */\n        article {\n            padding: 0 15px;\n        }\n\n        article img {\n            width: 100%;\n        }\n\n        article .little {\n            margin-bottom: .5em;\n        }\n\n        article .one {\n            margin-bottom: 1.5em;\n        }\n\n        article .double {\n            margin-bottom: 3em;\n        }\n\n        article .tit {\n            font-size: 18px;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: #02A7F0;\n            text-align: center;\n            letter-spacing: 2px;\n            line-height: 40px;\n            margin-bottom: 1.5em;\n        }\n\n        article .purple {\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: #C280FF;\n        }\n\n        article .red {\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: #EF4626;\n        }\n\n        article .red1 {\n            color: #EF4626;\n        }\n\n        article .black {\n            font-weight: 800;\n            color: #333333;\n\n        }\n\n        article p {\n            letter-spacing: 2px;\n            line-height: 40px;\n        }\n\n        .box {\n            background-color: #FDEAD1;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            text-align: left;\n            padding: 5px;\n        }\n\n        /* 板块2 */\n        .box2 .red {\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n\n        /* 板块4 */\n        .slie {\n            border: 3px dashed rgb(194, 128, 255);\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n            padding: 5px;\n        }\n\n        .slie>div {\n            background-color: #EEF9FE;\n            display: inline-block;\n        }\n\n        .slie .black {\n            text-align: center;\n            line-height: 100px;\n        }\n\n        /* 板块5 */\n        .box5>div:nth-child(3) .black {\n            text-align: center;\n            font-size: 18px;\n        }\n\n        /* 板块6 */\n        .box6>div:nth-child(2) {\n            background-color: #FDF1F2;\n            padding: 8px;\n        }\n\n        /* 板块7 */\n        .box7 .slie .red {\n            text-align: center;\n            line-height: 100px;\n        }\n\n        /* 末尾板块8 */\n        .box8 {\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n\n        .box8>button {\n            position: relative;\n            display: inline-block;\n            width: 250px;\n            padding: 10px 0;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n            text-align: center;\n            border-radius: 20px;\n            background-color: #16D352;\n            color: #fff;\n            outline: none;\n            border: none;\n            font-size: 18px;\n            animation: buttonHandle .75s ease infinite both;\n\n        }\n\n        .box8>button>p {\n            line-height: 30px;\n            font-size: 24px;\n            font-weight: 600;\n        }\n\n        .box8>button>p:nth-child(1) {\n            /* font-size: 28px; */\n            color: #FF7E00;\n            -webkit-text-stroke: 1px #fff;\n            font-weight: 800;\n            text-shadow: 0px 0px 30px #FF7E00;\n\n        }\n\n        @keyframes buttonHandle {\n            0% {\n                background-color: #16D352;\n            }\n\n            50% {\n                background-color: #2CEB6A;\n            }\n\n            100% {\n                background-color: #16D352;\n            }\n        }\n\n\n        /* 腳部區 */\n        footer>div {\n            text-align: center;\n            padding: 0;\n            margin: 0\n        }\n\n        footer>div>p {\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #cdcdcd;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 10px 0\n        }\n\n        footer>div>p>a {\n            color: #4267b2;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            text-decoration: none\n        }\n\n        footer>div>div>span {\n            font-size: .8em\n        }\n\n        footer>div>div .footerlogo {\n            margin-top: 4px;\n            height: 25px;\n            margin-bottom: -6px\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n\n<body>\n    <header id="wmheaderContainer">\n        <div class="comm_header">\n            <div class="top">\n                <div><span></span>\n                    <p>離美麗，你只有一步之遙</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class="comm_header_list">\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><a onclick="$$.goline()"><embed src="https://storage.licat.work/icon/appicon1.svg"\n                                    type="image/svg+xml" /></a></li>\n                        <li><a onclick="$$.goline()"><embed src="https://storage.licat.work/icon/appicon2.svg"\n                                    type="image/svg+xml" /></a></li>\n                        <li><a onclick="$$.goline()"><embed src="https://storage.licat.work/svg/appicon3.svg"\n                                    type="image/svg+xml" /></a></li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class="comm_header_nav" id="headermenu">\n                <div class="comm_header_nav_menu">\n                    <ul>\n                        <li>達人</li>\n                        <li class="active">漂亮</li>\n                        <li>瘦身</li>\n                        <li>感情</li>\n                        <li>風尚</li>\n                        <li>星事</li>\n                        <li>電視</li>\n                        <li>最美話題</li>\n                        <li>購物</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class="label"><span>首頁</span><span>台灣</span><span>漂亮</span></div>\n        <div class="comm_title">\n            <h1>搜尋頻次4000萬！熱門話題TOP1的抗衰老保養方法，能拯救衰老肌膚、改善皺紋鬆弛的竟是...........</h1>\n        </div>\n        <div class="comm_status">\n            <div class="comm_time">\n                <p><span class="color3 l_icon">漂亮</span><span class="color5">By 劉露欣</span><br><span class="color5"\n                        id="article_time"><span id="releaseDate"></span>&nbsp;11:36</span></p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n    <article>\n        <section>\n            <div class="double">\n                <div class="box">\n                    <p>「 早上起床，坐在沙發上我就開始哭，陽光再好我也在哭，就是可能我沒有辦法，那麼快速面對人的衰老這件事。」</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section>\n            <div class="box1 double">\n                <div class="tit">\n                    <p>年齡是你的恐懼嗎？</p>\n                    <p>衰老是否困擾著你？</p>\n                </div>\n                <p>根據相關調查報告表明：</p>\n                <p>在台灣，每100位成年女性當中，<span class="purple">就有93位希望比實際年齡看起來更年輕</span>，而「抗衰老」一詞的搜索率更是高得驚人！</p>\n                <div><img\n                        licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/917298378/O1CN01QbRxOX2BlAtm0xbA7_!!917298378.jpg"\n                        alt=""></div>\n                <p>抗衰老，已經成為我們生活中最熱門的話題 <span class="red">TOP 1</span>了。</p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section>\n            <div class="box2 double">\n                <div class="tit">\n                    <p>女人本身最大的恐懼，不是年齡本身，而是看上去衰老！</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class="one black">\n                    <p>而女性的「保鮮期」卻那麼短！</p>\n                    <p>靠科技嗎？拉皮、雷射、超聲刀？</p>\n                    <p>靠發育嗎？早睡、早起、多運動？</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class="little red">\n                    <p>不妨看看這個？</p>\n                    <p>↓ ↓ ↓</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class="little"><img\n                        licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/917298378/O1CN01edLh772BlAtiBVoz5_!!917298378.jpg"\n                        alt=""></div>\n                <p>簡單高效、安全省心的保養方法，對想要維持肌膚狀態的我們，必不可少！LISA團隊為此不斷嘗試，歷時951個日夜，近萬次的實驗，研發出一套適合亞洲人膚質的保養方法。</p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section>\n            <div class="box3 double">\n                <div class="tit">\n                    <p>衰老肌膚就用它！</p>\n                    <p>40歲肌膚一樣吹彈可破~</p>\n                </div>\n                <p class="one">受試者數據表明，它從30多種抗衰老保養方法盲測中脫穎而出。 <span class="black">近千受試者罕見的一致：「 <span class="red">效果TOP\n                            1</span>」！</span></p>\n                <p>看見她們都變美了，我當然也馬上試用了一下。驚艷到我的是，<span class="purple">僅僅一個月，臉蛋細滑到我差點都認不出自己~</span></p>\n                <div class="little"><img\n                        licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/917298378/O1CN01a5XoiE2BlAtnHJeop_!!917298378.jpg"\n                        alt=""></div>\n                <p class="red1 little">「鬆弛下垂的臉蛋真的超顯老！還有法令紋和眼袋，皮膚也比較暗沉發黃，看上去會很沒氣質~」</p>\n                <div><img\n                        licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/917298378/O1CN013OqRog2BlAtlqjz6h_!!917298378.jpg"\n                        alt=""></div>\n                <p>才一個月，我的肌膚就變得提拉緊致，<span class="purple">整體輪廓都更緊致上揚</span>，超喜歡這種自然變美的感覺~</p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section>\n            <div class="box4 double">\n                <div class="tit">\n                    <p>在網絡上搜尋一下</p>\n                    <p>還有很多人分享自己成功變美的喜悅~</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class="slie double">\n                    <div>\n                        <p class="black">細紋？放大鏡都找不到！</p>\n                        <p>皺紋和年齡沒有絕對的關係啦，我從25歲開始就開始用這個方法保養，直到現在40歲，臉上都沒有一絲皺紋！這是我用過除皺效果最理想的保養方法了，皮膚粉嫩嫩的，素顏出門都沒在怕的~</p>\n                        <div class="double"><img\n                                licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/917298378/O1CN01wSS5Ac2BlAtsZeN5y_!!917298378.png"\n                                alt=""></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class="slie one">\n                    <div>\n                        <p class="black">Q彈十足，慢慢活力少女感！</p>\n                        <p>臉上狂補膠原蛋白的感覺！皮膚像是果凍一樣彈力十足~說年輕幾歲都不誇張，滿滿的元氣活力！我的妹妹都不和我逛街了，可能是怕別人叫他姐姐吧XDD~</p>\n                        <div class="double"><img\n                                licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/917298378/O1CN01azSSTV2BlAtsZgWBt_!!917298378.png"\n                                alt=""></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <p>皮膚嫩滑得就像是水煮雞蛋一樣，<span class="red">40歲的熟齡女性竟然擁有20歲般的肌膚？！</span>一個簡單的方法就能搞定，你能想象嗎？</p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section>\n            <div class="box5 double">\n                <div class="tit">\n                    <p>日本研發專家</p>\n                    <p>360度解密嫩臉肌密</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class="double">\n                    <p class="black little">隨著年齡的增長，肌膚代謝率下降和膠原蛋白的減少</p>\n                    <div class="one"><img\n                            licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/917298378/O1CN01Txoifv2BlAtoPJUnd_!!917298378.jpg"\n                            alt=""></div>\n                    <div class="box one">\n                        <p>膠原蛋白支撐著真皮層，當寶貴的膠原蛋白流失，膠原纖維恢復能力便會減弱，一旦肌膚受到拉扯，纖維網就會逐漸變形無法恢復</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="one"><img\n                            licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/917298378/O1CN01HKibQ22BlAtrBB9IT_!!917298378.gif"\n                            alt=""></div>\n                    <p>而Lisa特別添加一種<span class="red">煥活生長因子</span>，<span\n                            class="purple">能促進膠原蛋白生長，讓肌膚充盈飽滿，撫平一道又一道凹槽般的皺紋</span></p>\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                    <p class="black little">實驗檢測：</p>\n                    <p><span class="blue">把煥活生長因子和清水分別擦在紙上</span>，第二天擦清水的紙變得 <span class="black">褶皺、乾裂</span>；而另一邊，\n                        <span class="purple">擦了煥活生長因子的紙就像是新的一樣~</span></p>\n                    <div><img\n                            licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/917298378/O1CN01jnwFb82BlAtmhqO25_!!917298378.gif"\n                            alt=""></div>\n                    <p>能夠<span class="blue">快速撫平皺紋</span>，<span class="blue">保持肌膚水潤彈力</span>的秘密就是<span\n                            class="red">添加了百萬分子量的煥活生長因子！</span></p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section>\n            <div class="box6 double">\n                <div class="tit">\n                    <p>時尚PO主親自測評</p>\n                    <p>見證細紋隱形</p>\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                    <p class="one">“<span class="red">使用一個月，皮膚水潤透亮，乾紋不見了</span>”</p>\n                    <p>這個保養方法只需要每天花幾分鐘的時 間，皮膚就能潤潤的飽滿到能捏出水來， </p>\n                    <p class="black little">煥然一新的肌膚真的一道小細紋都沒有~</p>\n                    <div class="little"><img\n                            licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/917298378/O1CN019LTjsm2BlAtmJmjgh_!!917298378.png"\n                            alt=""></div>\n                    <p>不知不覺就使用了一個月，發現肌膚緊致光滑了很多欸！眼紋、暗沉的肌膚拜拜啦~</p>\n                    <p class="red little">拍照不用美肌APP也超A的啦！</p>\n                    <div class="little"><img\n                            licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/917298378/O1CN01qcMjWM2BlAtlrUAzp_!!917298378.png"\n                            alt=""></div>\n                    <p class="one">這種效果實在太驚艷，心動到爆燈！改善了細紋和暗沉之後真的超顯年輕，我說逆齡了10歲也不過分哈哈哈~</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section>\n            <div class="box7 double">\n                <div class="tit">\n                    <p>使用者好評如潮</p>\n                    <p>十年如一日的肌膚才是心動的感覺</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class="slie double">\n                    <div>\n                        <p class="red">@舒婷 35歲 銷售經理</p>\n                        <div class="one"><img\n                                licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/917298378/O1CN01PhlB1i2BlAtn2rD5l_!!917298378.jpg"\n                                alt=""></div>\n                        <p class="one">就在我步入35歲，我發現臉蛋相比以前會比較沒有彈性，開始鬆弛下垂，皮膚也沒有以前的光澤，皺紋、眼袋通通都冒出來了！</p>\n                        <p class="one">還好有閨蜜給我介紹了Lisa的這個保養方法，現在<span class="red1">臉蛋整體提拉上揚，更加彰顯活力年輕~</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class="slie">\n                    <div>\n                        <p class="red">@莉娜 42歲 家庭主婦</p>\n                        <div class="one"><img\n                                licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/917298378/O1CN01ugYh9C2BlAtp89T3T_!!917298378.jpg"\n                                alt=""></div>\n                        <p class="one">我覺得很多女性都是比較介意自己臉上有皺紋，<span class="red1">一道道皺紋還會增加內心的自卑感，根本不敢素顏出門！</span></p>\n                        <p class="one">自從我認識了Lisa之後，肌膚得到很好的改善，<span class="red1">撫平皺紋、細膩毛孔原來就是這麼簡單~</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section>\n            <div class="box8 double">\n                <p>25歲之後，肌膚開始加速氧化</p>\n                <p>再不抓緊時間抗衰老</p>\n                <p>真的和同齡人差距愈來愈大了....</p>\n                <p class="one">而現在，就是你變美的最好時機！</p>\n                <button class="one" onclick="$$.goline()">\n                    <p>★<line></line>★</p>\n                    <p>馬上加入LINE好友</p>\n                </button>\n                <p>現在開始，你也可以很美！</p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </article>\n    <section id="commentContainer"></section>\n    <footer>\n        <div>\n            <p><a href="javascript:$$.footer()">查看更多</a></p>\n            <div><img class="footerlogo"\n                    licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/917298378/O1CN016ghgP42BlAsmhfSwr_!!917298378.png"\n                    style="height:25px;width:84px;"><br><span>未經允許，禁止轉載</span><span\n                    id="showDisclaimer">&nbsp;網站聲明</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div id="Disclaimer" style="text-align:left;"></div>\n        <div style="height:50px"></div>\n    </footer>\n\n\n</body>\n<script>\n\n    var webconfig = {\n        baseHost: "www.lisa-tw.com",\n        storageUrl: "https://storage.licat.work/v4/",\n        syncJS: [],\n        asyncJS: [''comment.min'', ''mainButton.min'', ''msgPopup.min'', ''Disclaimer.min''],\n        defaultdata: {\n            code1: '''',\n            code2: '''',\n            code3: '''',\n            line_id: "anby80",\n            line_url_mb: "line://ti/p/KUDSID8PyX",\n            line_url_pc: "https://line.me/R/ti/p/KUDSID8PyX",\n        },\n        mainButton: {\n            bgColor: "#C280FF",\n            ftColor: "#fff",\n            innerText: "加LINE領取獨家逆齡祕笈",\n            leftImg: "https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/917298378/O1CN01X6zxhD2BlArEJekrd_!!917298378.jpg",\n            timeout: 10000,\n        },\n        msgPopup: {\n            topImgAOS: "https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/917298378/O1CN01tSZ5X82BlAr8LENYc_!!917298378.png",\n            topImgIOS: "https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/917298378/O1CN01PwE8BZ2BlArBMvjrc_!!917298378.png",\n            centerImg: "https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/917298378/O1CN01Nv7Igt2BlAr7LLUbe_!!917298378.jpg",\n            topTimeout: 30000,\n            centerTimeout: 180000,\n            centerColor: "#6ebbe9",\n            name: ''Lisa&nbsp;''\n        },\n        comment: {\n            language: ''zh'',\n            total: "33",\n            serverApi: "https://licat.work/api/usercomment",\n            gravatarUrl: "https://storage.licat.work/gravatar/",\n            commentimgUrl: "",\n            content: [{\n                gravatar: ''34.jpg'',\n                name: ''珍珍'',\n                content: ''以前涂上一層厚厚的粉底都遮不住臉上的皺紋！現在只要擦上一層安耐曬就可以出門啦，淡化掉皺紋每一天都超自信的！'',\n                img: ''https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/917298378/O1CN01B2CJQE2BlAts3cnsW_!!917298378.jpg'',\n                like: 66,\n            }, {\n                gravatar: ''19.jpg'',\n                name: ''kiki'',\n                content: ''效果完全超出我的預期耶！沒想到才2個月時間臉上的皺紋和小色斑淡化得這麼快！而且Lisa會一直關懷著我的肌膚狀態，超滿意的~'',\n                img: ''https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/917298378/O1CN01GlQU842BlAtlrWvYM_!!917298378.png'',\n                like: 54,\n            }, {\n                gravatar: ''39.jpg'',\n                name: ''雅纯'',\n                content: ''姊妹介紹給我Lisa幫我改善肌膚衰老問題，剛開始使用，期待那個變美的自己~'',\n                like: 62,\n            }, {\n                gravatar: ''71.jpg'',\n                name: ''小熙'',\n                content: ''臉上皺紋小時之後每一天心情都有變得比較好喲，Lisa會跟我科普很多保養小撇步，幫助了我很多，非常感謝！~'',\n                like: 187,\n            }, {\n                gravatar: ''41.jpg'',\n                name: ''Diana'',\n                content: ''使用了兩個月才看回以前的照片，我才發現簡直換了個人似的，肌膚緊致提拉，年輕了不少呢！推薦姊妹們嘗試一下~'',\n                img: ''https://img.a