(9, 1, '2021-03-27', '张国钦', 'C', '日本人氣TOP除斑保養方法！色斑愈抹愈淡，臉蛋愈來愈白，讓你擺脫「黃臉」困擾！', 'https://licat.work/storage/topic/20210327/709e824dc3ffd0884aec6037110c1589.', 'Anna', 1, '<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang="en">\n<head>\n    <meta charset="UTF-8">\n    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">\n    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">\n    <title>日本人氣TOP除斑保養方法！色斑愈抹愈淡，臉蛋愈來愈白，讓你擺脫「黃臉」困擾！</title>\n    <link rel="shortcut icon" href="https://storage.licat.work/favicon/woman.ico">\n    <script async src="https://storage.licat.work/v4/licat.min.js?update=2020.12.05"></script>\n\n    <style>\n        *{\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n        }\n        body{\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            font-family: ''Arial Negreta'', ''Arial Normal'', ''Arial'';\n            max-width: 600px;\n        }\n\n        /* 头部区 */\n        #wmheaderContainer{\n            margin-bottom: 2em;\n        }\n        .comm_header {\n            width: 100%\n        }\n\n        .top {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 35px;\n            padding-top: 5px;\n            background-color: #fff;\n            position: relative;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n        }\n\n        .top span {\n            width: 30px;\n            height: 30px;\n            float: left;\n            /* margin-left: 10px; */\n        }\n\n        .top p {\n            float: left;\n            font-family: 微軟儷黑體, 微軟正黑體, Arial, Helvetica, Microsoft JhengHei;\n            line-height: 27px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            font-weight: 900;\n        }\n\n        .top>div:nth-child(1)>span {\n            background: url(https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/917298378/O1CN01gFxglr2BlAtn42My9_!!917298378.png)0 -90px no-repeat;\n        }\n\n        /* 導航欄 */\n        .top .comm_header_list {\n            /* margin: auto 15px auto auto; */\n            /* margin: 15px 15px 0; */\n            margin-right: 5px;\n            display: block;\n            line-height: 40px;\n        }\n\n        .top .comm_header_list>ul {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            list-style: none;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            line-height: 45px;\n        }\n\n        .top .comm_header_list>ul>li {\n            float: left;\n            width: 25px;\n            height: 25px;\n            margin-left: 5px;\n            /* position: relative; */\n            padding: 0;\n            list-style: none;\n            display: list-item;\n            text-align: -webkit-match-parent\n        }\n\n        .top .comm_header_list>ul>li>img {\n            width: 100%;\n            border: 0\n        }\n\n        .comm_header_nav {\n            border-top: 1px solid #000000;\n            height: 45px;\n            width: 100%;\n            font-family: 微軟儷黑體, 微軟正黑體, Arial, Helvetica, Microsoft JhengHei\n        }\n\n        .comm_header_nav .comm_header_nav_menu {\n            background-color: #fff;\n            color: #000000;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            max-width: 800px\n        }\n\n        .comm_header_nav .comm_header_nav_menu>ul {\n            list-style-type: none;\n            display: -webkit-box;\n            display: -webkit-flex;\n            padding: 0;\n            overflow: auto;\n            margin: 0\n        }\n\n        .comm_header_nav .comm_header_nav_menu>ul>li {\n            font-size: 18px;\n            padding: 0 13px;\n            line-height: 45px;\n            white-space: nowrap;\n            position: relative;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            float: left;\n            list-style: none\n        }\n\n        .comm_header_nav .comm_header_nav_menu>ul .active {\n            color: #ffaaaf\n        }\n\n        /* 麵包屑 */\n        .label {\n            background-color: #EFEFEF;\n            height: 40px;\n            line-height: 40px;\n            padding-lef