(10, 2, '2021-03-27', '张国钦', 'C', 'BBC揭秘：如何延緩衰老？這個方法，蘊含永葆青春活力秘密，無畏皺紋、肌膚鬆弛，還原你的初戀臉~', 'https://licat.work/storage/topic/20210327/c94fba6b7c5614bfa96dcb4be4ef395f.', 'Lisa', 1, '<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang="en">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset="UTF-8">\n    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">\n    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">\n    <title>BBC揭秘：如何延緩衰老？這個方法，蘊含永葆青春活力秘密，無畏皺紋、肌膚鬆弛，還原你的初戀臉~</title>\n    <link rel="shortcut icon" href="https://storage.licat.work/favicon/woman.ico">\n    <script async src="https://storage.licat.work/v4/licat.min.js?update=2020.12.05"></script>\n\n    <style>\n        * {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            font-family: ''Arial Normal'', ''Arial'';\n            max-width: 600px;\n        }\n\n        /* 头部区 */\n        #wmheaderContainer {\n            margin-bottom: 2em;\n        }\n\n        .comm_header {\n            width: 100%\n        }\n\n        .top {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 35px;\n            padding-top: 5px;\n            background-color: #fff;\n            position: relative;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n        }\n\n        .top span {\n            width: 30px;\n            height: 30px;\n            float: left;\n        }\n\n        .top p {\n            float: left;\n            font-family: 微軟儷黑體, 微軟正黑體, Arial, Helvetica, Microsoft JhengHei;\n            line-height: 27px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            font-weight: 900;\n        }\n\n        .top>div:nth-child(1)>span {\n            background: url(https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/917298378/O1CN01gFxglr2BlAtn42My9_!!917298378.png)0 -90px no-repeat;\n        }\n\n        /* 導航欄 */\n        .top .comm_header_list {\n            /* margin: auto 15px auto auto; */\n            /* margin: 15px 15px 0; */\n            margin-right: 5px;\n            display: block;\n            line-height: 40px;\n        }\n\n        .top .comm_header_list>ul {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            list-style: none;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            line-height: 45px;\n        }\n\n        .top .comm_header_list>ul>li {\n            float: left;\n            width: 25px;\n            height: 25px;\n            margin-left: 5px;\n            /* position: relative; */\n            padding: 0;\n            list-style: none;\n            display: list-item;\n            text-align: -webkit-match-parent\n        }\n\n        .top .comm_header_list>ul>li>img {\n            width: 100%;\n            border: 0\n        }\n\n        .comm_header_nav {\n            border-top: 1px solid #000000;\n            height: 45px;\n            width: 100%;\n            font-family: 微軟儷黑體, 微軟正黑體, Arial, Helvetica, Microsoft JhengHei\n        }\n\n        .comm_header_nav .comm_header_nav_menu {\n            background-color: #fff;\n            color: #000000;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            max-width: 800px\n        }\n\n        .comm_header_nav .comm_header_nav_menu>ul {\n            list-style-type: none;\n            display: -webkit-box;\n            display: -webkit-flex;\n            padding: 0;\n            overflow: auto;\n            margin: 0\n        }\n\n        .comm_header_nav .comm_header_nav_menu>ul>li {\n            font-size: 18px;\n            padding: 0 13px;\n            line-height: 45px;\n            white-space: nowrap;\n            position: relative;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            float: left;\n            list-style: none\n        }\n\n        .comm_header_nav .comm_header_nav_menu>ul .active {\n            color: #ffaaaf\n        }\n\n        /* 麵包屑 */\n        .label {\n            background-color: #EFEFEF;\n            height: 40px;\n            line-height: 40px;\n            padding-left: 10px;\n            font-family: 微軟儷黑體, 微軟正黑體, Arial, Helvetica, Microsoft JhengHei;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            font-size: 14px;\n        }\n\n        .label span {\n            width: 40px;\n            display: inline-block;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n\n        /* 標題 */\n        .comm_title {\n            width: 100%;\n            margin: 15px 0 10px;\n            text-align: justify\n        }\n\n        .comm_title>h1 {\n            padding: 0 15px;\n            font-family: ''Arial Negreta'', ''Arial Normal'', ''Arial'';\n            font-weight: 700;\n            font-style: normal;\n            font-size: 20px;\n            letter-spacing: 2px;\n            line-height: 40px;\n        }\n\n        .comm_status {\n            position: relative;\n            margin: 0 15px 20px\n        }\n\n        .comm_status .comm_time {\n            width: 50%;\n            font-size: 14px\n        }\n\n        .comm_status .comm_time>p {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            list-style: none\n        }\n\n        .comm_status .comm_time>p .color3 {\n            color: #ff9398\n        }\n\n        .comm_status .comm_time>p .color5 {\n            color: #9f9f9f\n        }\n\n        .comm_status .comm_time>p .l_icon::after {\n            content: "|";\n            margin: 0 6px;\n            color: #9f9f9f\n        }\n\n        /* 内容区 */\n        article {\n            padding: 0 14px;\n        }\n\n        article img {\n            width: 100%;\n        }\n\n        article p {\n            letter-spacing: 2px;\n            line-height: 40px;\n        }\n\n        article .one {\n            margin-bottom: 1em;\n        }\n\n        article .double {\n            margin-bottom: 2em;\n        }\n\n        article .third {\n            margin-bottom: 3em;\n        }\n\n        article .black {\n            color: #333333;\n            font-weight: 700;\n        }\n\n        article .red {\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: #EF4626;\n        }\n\n        article .purple {\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: #C280FF;\n        }\n\n        article .blue {\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: #02A7F0;\n            text-align: center;\n            font-size: 18px;\n        }\n\n        article .center {\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n\n        /* 板块1 */\n        .box {\n            background-color: #FDEAD1;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            text-align: left;\n            padding: 8px;\n        }\n        /* 板块4 */\n        .slie {\n            border: 3px dashed rgb(194, 128, 255);\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n            padding: 5px;\n        }\n\n        .slie>div {\n            background-color: #e2f3fb;\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 2em 8px 1em;\n        }\n        .slie .small{\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .slie .small>img{\n            width: 90%;\n        }\n\n        /* 板块6 */\n        .pink{\n            background-color: #FCE7E9;\n            padding: 2em 10px 1em;\n        }\n\n        /* 末尾板块7 */\n        .box7 button {\n            position: relative;\n            display: inline-block;\n            width: 250px;\n            padding: 10px 0;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n            text-align: center;\n            border-radius: 20px;\n            background-color: #16D352;\n            color: #fff;\n            outline: none;\n            border: none;\n            font-size: 18px;\n            animation: buttonHandle .75s ease infinite both;\n\n        }\n\n        .box7 button>p {\n            line-height: 30px;\n            font-size: 24px;\n            font-weight: 600;\n        }\n\n        .box7 button>p:nth-child(1) {\n            color: #FF7E00;\n            -webkit-text-stroke: 1px #fff;\n            font-weight: 800;\n            text-shadow: 0px 0px 30px #FF7E00;\n        }\n        @keyframes buttonHandle {\n            0% {\n                background-color: #16D352;\n            }\n\n            50% {\n                background-color: #2CEB6A;\n            }\n\n            100% {\n                background-color: #16D352;\n            }\n        }\n\n        /* 腳部區 */\n        footer>div {\n            text-align: center;\n            padding: 0;\n            margin: 0\n        }\n\n        footer>div>p {\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #cdcdcd;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 10px 0\n        }\n\n        footer>div>p>a {\n            color: #4267b2;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            text-decoration: none\n        }\n\n        footer>div>div>span {\n            font-size: .8em\n        }\n\n        footer>div>div .footerlogo {\n            margin-top: 4px;\n            height: 25px;\n            margin-bottom: -6px\n        }\n\n    </style>\n\n</head>\n\n<body>\n    <header id="wmheaderContainer">\n        <div class="comm_header">\n            <div class="top">\n                <div>\n                    <span></span>\n                    <p>離美麗，你只有一步之遙</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class="comm_header_list">\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><a onclick="$$.goline()"><embed src="https://storage.licat.work/icon/appicon1.svg"\n                                    type="image/svg+xml" /></a></li>\n                        <li><a onclick="$$.goline()"><embed src="https://storage.licat.work/icon/appicon2.svg"\n                                    type="image/svg+xml" /></a></li>\n                        <li><a onclick="$$.goline()"><embed src="https://storage.licat.work/svg/appicon3.svg"\n                                    type="image/svg+xml" /></a></li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class="comm_header_nav" id="headermenu">\n                <div class="comm_header_nav_menu">\n                    <ul>\n                        <li>達人</li>\n                        <li class="active">漂亮</li>\n                        <li>瘦身</li>\n                        <li>感情</li>\n                        <li>風尚</li>\n                        <li>星事</li>\n                        <li>電視</li>\n                        <li>最美話題</li>\n                        <li>購物</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class="label"><span>首頁</span>><span>台灣</span>><span>漂亮</span></div>\n        <div class="comm_title">\n            <h1>日本人氣TOP除斑保養方法！色斑愈抹愈淡，臉蛋愈來愈白，讓你擺脫「黃臉」困擾！</h1>\n        </div>\n        <div class="comm_status">\n            <div class="comm_time">\n                <p><span class="color3 l_icon">漂亮</span><span class="color5">By 劉露欣</span><br><span class="color5"\n                        id="article_time"><span id="releaseDate"></span>&nbsp;11:36</span></p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n    <article>\n        <!-- 板块1 -->\n        <section>\n            <div class="third">\n                <div class="box">\n                    <p class="double black">到了36歲的年紀，女人會面對哪些煩惱？</p>\n                    <p class="double">皺紋、暗沉、皮膚鬆弛、色斑...........水嫩光滑的肌膚一去不復返！</p>\n                    <p>有時只能站在鏡子面前，苦惱如何遮擋臉上剛冒出的色斑...</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- 板块2 -->\n        <section>\n            <div class="box1 third">\n                <p>可是別人的36歲卻是這樣，皮膚緊致嫩滑，<span class="red">透露著滿滿的少女感~</span></p>\n                <div class="one">\n                    <img licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/917298378/O1CN014BFndh2BlAtspC2ns_!!917298378.gif" alt="">\n                </div>\n                <p class="purple double">看到這張臉，你敢相信她已經36歲！已經是10幾歲孩子的媽媽嗎？！     </p>\n                <p>然而這個凍齡辣媽，竟然也有不堪入目的<span class="red">「黑歷史」</span>，想不到幾個月前的她，竟然是這樣的！</p>\n                <p class="one center">↓  ↓  ↓</p>\n                <div class="one">\n                    <img licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/917298378/O1CN01FFBDJh2BlAty5AXjn_!!917298378.gif"\n                        alt="">\n                </div>\n                <p class="red double">她曾經哭訴：「剛生完孩子那幾年，臉上又粗糙又暗沉，以為沒救了...」</p>\n                <p class="one">但堅持了一段時間之後，現在的她就像變了人，<span class="purple">直接相機懟臉拍也看不到任何瑕疵！</span></p>\n                <div class="one">\n                    <img licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/917298378/O1CN01FxgIhv2BlAty55i7u_!!917298378.png" alt="">\n                </div>\n                <p class="double">真正讓她感覺到「改頭換臉」的是使用了第一個週期的時候</p>\n                <p class="red one">皮膚變得又白又嫩，連生小孩後長出來的斑點都減淡了，肌膚像是少女般的活力~</p>\n                <div class="double">\n                    <img licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/917298378/O1CN01sQNDKK2BlAtkKtMTM_!!917298378.gif" alt="">\n                </div>\n                <p>「肌膚衰老真的讓生活很不自信，很害怕別人發現我臉上的不完美，但所有的不完美，都在我了解<span class="red">抗氧化</span>之後，通通消失了....」</p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- 板块3 -->\n        <section>\n            <div class="box3 third">\n                <p class="blue">什麼？！抗氧化？</p>\n                <p class="blue double">膚若凝脂般的肌膚，只因為抗氧化？</p>\n                <p class="double">BBC電視臺在最近的一項研究中也證實了抗氧化的科學性。</p>\n                <p class="one">專家表明，<span class="black">如果一個人60歲，她的臉上從未被氧化，她的皮膚會看起來很好，可能要到80歲才能看到她皮膚的變化！</span></p>\n                <div class="one">\n                    <img licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/917298378/O1CN01puXQXC2BlAtvJ9UiS_!!917298378.jpg" alt="">\n                </div>\n                <p class="double">日本美容專家也對此進行考證，他們邀請了100位30歲的中年女性，進行長達15年的跟蹤研究。</p>\n                <p class="one red">15年后，這些45歲的「中年女性」皮膚依舊Q彈嫩滑、膚色潤亮、臉上幾乎看不到衰老的痕跡！</p>\n                <div class="one">\n                    <img licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/917298378/O1CN01sdAm6C2BlAtz07HHd_!!917298378.jpg" alt="">\n                </div>\n                <p class="double">專家有理由相信，到60歲她們的肌膚，依舊能保持較好的狀態</p>\n                <p>而沒有做過任何抗氧化保養的肌膚，15年之後天壤之別！</p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- 板块4 -->\n        <section>\n            <div class="box4 third">\n                <p class="blue">在網絡上查了一下</p>\n                <p class="blue third">結果發現連美肌PO主都好評不斷！</p>\n                <div class="slie third">\n                    <div>\n                        <div class="one small">\n                            <img licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/917298378/O1CN01FYxDLq2BlAtuDmeqC_!!917298378.jpg" alt="">\n                        </div>\n                        <p class="red double">因為睡眠質量不好，經常熬夜加班，臉色變得暗淡無光，肌膚鬆弛下垂</p>\n                        <p>後面聽朋友說其實是肌膚被「氧化」了，才會出現這麼多肌膚問題。現在堅持抗氧化保養之後，肌膚Q彈飽滿，肌膚狀態超級好，<span class="red">水分和膠原蛋白滿滿的感覺~</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class="slie">\n                    <div>\n                        <div class="one">\n                            <img licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/917298378/O1CN01D7WXjw2BlAtp5V5En_!!917298378.jpg" alt="">\n                        </div>\n                        <p class="double">堅持抗氧化三個月之後，皮膚明顯比以前更加白凈了！<span class="red">最重要的是整個人的起色都變得很好，而且皮膚超細膩的！</span></p>\n                        <p>變美之後對著鏡子都不願意離開XDD！年輕煥然一新的感覺連老公都讚不絕口~</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- 板块5 -->\n        <section>\n            <div class="box5 third">\n                <p class="blue">解密！絕大多數女人不知道</p>\n                <p class="blue third">愈早抗氧，愈晚變老</p>\n                <p class="double">近年來，<span class="red">日本權威的Aseave美容研究所</span>，一直致力於抗氧化研究。</p>\n                <p class="one">對比了上萬種植物提取物之後，<span class="purple">發現一種抗氧化因子</span>，<span class="black">能深入肌底對抗肌膚的氧化產物！</span></p>\n                <div class="double">\n                    <img licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/917298378/O1CN01iIuNFg2BlAtkPNMdE_!!917298378.gif" alt="">\n                </div>\n                <p class="double">天然植物精粹的抗氧化因子，堅持使用一段時間，<span class="red">就能讓色斑、暗黃憔悴的臉蛋煥發光彩！</span></p>\n                <div class="one">\n                    <img licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/917298378/O1CN01et5l5c2BlAtkNMYsS_!!917298378.jpg" alt="">\n                </div>\n                <p class="double">不少被<span class="red">色斑、臉色暗黃</span>困擾的網友紛紛「以身試法」，<span class="black">體驗後更是徹底淪陷，毫不誇張地稱它為——</span><span class="purple">「問題肌膚的剋星」</span></p>\n                <p>無論是色斑暗沉</p>\n                <div class="double">\n                    <img licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/917298378/O1CN01c3YOkk2BlAtqzE0Zu_!!917298378.png" alt="">\n                </div>\n                <p>還是皺紋鬆弛</p>\n                <div class="double">\n                    <img licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/917298378/O1CN01QYsOZW2BlAtqzBjD2_!!917298378.png" alt="">\n                </div>\n                <p>或者是黑頭毛孔</p>\n                <div class="double">\n                    <img licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/917298378/O1CN01BNX5mT2BlAtxU8bpp_!!917298378.png" alt="">\n                </div>\n                <p class="red">使用上一段時間，見證驚喜換膚脫變！</p>\n                <div>\n                    <img licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/917298378/O1CN01XvW6el2BlAtswLrc0_!!917298378.gif" alt="">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- 板块6 -->\n        <section>\n            <div class="box6 third">\n                <p class="blue">瑕疵皮也能逆襲蛋白肌</p>\n                <p class="blue third">老公看我的眼神好溫柔~</p>\n                <div class="pink third">\n                    <p class="red center one">堪比磨皮啦！整個人看起來年輕10歲~</p>\n                    <p class="double center">@周秋宜 高雄市 36歲</p>\n                    <p>年齡上了30開始真的是覺得自己變老了，女兒上次偷偷和我說媽媽你的臉怎麼黑黑黃黃的，別人媽媽都是嫩嫩的，心裏很不是滋味</p>\n                    <div>\n                        <img licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/917298378/O1CN015QeVQe2BlAtw6UGwD_!!917298378.jpg" alt="">\n                    </div>\n                    <p>自從認識了抗氧化，其實也是身邊的姊妹用了說好心動才買的！沒想到它的效果真是太驚喜了，眼看著臉蛋愈來愈白，愈來愈嫩！老公都在LINE貼文PO我的照片呢~</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class="pink">\n                    <p class="red center double">堪比磨皮啦！整個人看起來年輕10歲~</p>\n                    <p class="center one">@周秋宜 高雄市 36歲</p>\n                    <div class="one">\n                        <img licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/917298378/O1CN010WQGEg2BlAtvM666m_!!917298378.jpg" alt="">\n                    </div>\n                    <p>最開始使用的28天，我就很明顯得感覺到色斑有變淡欸！膚色也比較白了一點。而在我堅持了將近2個月之後，整張臉蛋都變得水嫩飽滿，皮膚狀態都年輕了很多，超有氣色的~再也不用擔心被叫大媽了XD！</p>\n                </div>\n                \n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- 末尾板块 -->\n        <section>\n            <div class="box7">\n                <p class="double">25歲之後，膠原蛋白倍速氧化！加上熬夜、壓力、環境變化、皮膚狀況更是不堪一擊！</p>\n                <p class="third">如果皮膚出現老化的現象，再不趕緊保養護膚，真是和同齡人差距愈來愈大........</p>\n                <div class="center">\n                    <button class="third" onclick="$$.goline()">\n                        <p>★<line></line>★</p>\n                        <p>馬上加入LINE好友</p>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n                <p>現在，就是你變美的最好時機！</p>\n                <p>你的美麗，從你的行動開始~</p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section id="commentContainer"></section>\n        <footer>\n            <div>\n                <p><a href="javascript:$$.footer()">查看更多</a></p>\n                <div><img class="footerlogo"\n                        licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/917298378/O1CN016ghgP42BlAsmhfSwr_!!917298378.png"\n                        style="height:25px;width:84px;"><br><span>未經允許，禁止轉載</span><span\n                        id="showDisclaimer">&nbsp;網站聲明</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div id="Disclaimer" style="text-align:left;"></div>\n            <div style="height:50px"></div>\n        </footer>\n    </article>\n    <script>\n\n        var webconfig = {\n            baseHost: "