(11, 2, '2021-04-02', '张国钦', 'A', '凍齡女神顏值不"迫降"，42歲依舊美若初戀！抗皺緊膚、美白提亮原來全靠這招!', 'https://licat.work/storage/topic/20210402/da4ea5d0a8d297d7bda718c9c36b7973.', '抗老目前跑得最好的（2021/4/2）', 1, '<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang="zh-Hant-TW">\n\n<head>\n	<meta charset="utf-8">\n	<meta content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0,maximum-scale=1.0,user-scalable=no" id="viewport"\n		name="viewport" />\n	<title>凍齡女神顏值不“迫降”，42歲依舊美若初戀!抗皺緊膚、美白提亮原來全靠這招!</title>\n	<style>\n	    html{font-size:10px;background-color:#fff}body{max-width:750px;margin:0 auto;font-family:Noto Sans TC,"微軟正黑體",Microsoft JhengHei,sans-serif;font-size:18px}p{line-height:1.7}.red{color:#ef4626}.cu{font-weight:700}.w1{width:100%}.blue{color:#02a7f0}.ye_bg{background-color:#ff0}.zhong{text-align:center}.top{padding:0 1.5rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:5rem;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;border-bottom:1px solid #ef0e7c}.top img{width:25px}.top svg{width:12rem}.top>.dingyue{color:#ef4626;font-size:13px;font-weight:700}.top>.dingyue>.jian{width:18px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:.5rem}.webh1{font-weight:800;font-size:1.5em;color:#ef4626}.article{padding:0 15px;box-sizing:border-box}.article h1{font-size:25px}.article>.titleNav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.article>.titleNav>.left>span{font-size:13px;color:#ef4626;margin-left:.5rem;font-weight:700}.article>.titleNav>.right>span{font-size:13px;color:#ef4626;font-weight:700}#comments_list{text-align:left}.casebox{    background-color: ghostwhite;box-shadow: 0 0 5px lightgrey;padding: 0 10px;margin-bottom: 20px;}.storybox{border: 1px solid #ef4626;margin-bottom: 20px;}\n	</style>\n\n</head>\n\n<body>\n	<div class="top">\n		<div><img src="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/917298378/O1CN01CKxTzZ2BlArEzyZmo_!!917298378.png" /></div>\n		<div class="webh1">TALKSKIN</div>\n		<div class="dingyue"><img src="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/917298378/O1CN01gIgCqo2BlArEzvI42_!!917298378.png" class="jian" />訂閱</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class="article">\n		<h1>凍齡女神顏值不"迫降"，42歲依舊美若初戀！抗皺緊膚、美白提亮原來全靠這招!</h1>\n		<div class="titleNav">\n			<p class="left"><span>by EVA LEE</span><span>與</span><span>LUCY HSU</span></p>\n			<img src="https://assets.hearstapps.com/sites/cosmopolitan/assets/images/svgs/author-arrow.a0a710a.svg"\n				style="transform: rotate(180deg);width: 50px;filter: invert(54%) sepia(74%) saturate(4066%) hue-rotate(145deg) brightness(93%) contrast(101%);">\n			<p class="right"><span id=ReleaseDate>...</span></p>\n		</div>\n		<div>\n			<p class="cu">「把老公熬成爹，和女兒做姊妹」</p>\n			<p>把自己活成奢侈品</p>\n			<p>這是女人的最終夢想，也是女人堅持保養的原因</p>\n			<img src="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/917298378/O1CN015RJls02BlAr9O6LQk_!!917298378.jpg" style="width: 100%;" />\n			<p>在她的臉上看不出一絲衰老的痕跡,沒有<span class="red cu">皺紋、肌膚鬆弛</span>的困擾也太幸福了吧!</p>\n			<p>肌膚如此白嫩無暇的她，你們猜猜看她幾歲了？</p>\n			<img src="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/917298378/O1CN01B6MIY92BlAr7ky7bm_!!917298378.jpg" class="w1" />\n			<p>你們應該都認為她是25歲吧？或者是30歲？但是...</p>\n			<p class="blue cu">她叫瑄宇，已經是13歲孩子的媽媽了！實際年齡已經40歲了！</p>\n			<img src="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/917298378/O1CN01IQbwzs2BlAr7FvVUg_!!917298378.jpg" class="w1" />\n			<p>完美的面部輪廓和立體飽滿的肌膚讓人羨慕，和女兒一起拍照就像是姊妹一樣！完全不敢相信這是40歲的膚質</p>\n			<img src="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/917298378/O1CN017txnjs2BlArDs4iAL_!!917298378.png" class="w1" />\n			<p>一次在IG上看朋友分享的照片時,竟然看到她分享自己<span class="blue cu">凍齡秘密</span>,40歲看上去竟然可以這麼年輕！</p>\n			<p class="cu">還有超多人使用她的保養方法之後<br /><span class="red">成功凍齡!!!</span></p>\n			<img src="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/917298378/O1CN01Fzwz3d2BlAr1ehee5_!!917298378.gif" class="w1" />\n			<img src="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/917298378/O1CN01c70t1T2BlAr7pmOs0_!!917298378.gif" class="w1" />\n			<p class="red cu">一度放棄的老臉，仿佛看到蛻變的希望</p>\n			<p>我之前的肌膚狀態超級糟糕的，甚至看到鏡中自己，就會產生莫名的自卑感</p>\n			<img src="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/917298378/O1CN01Zmd57q2BlArTMYoAL_!!917298378.jpg" class="w1" />\n			<p class="cu red">臃腫的眼袋、鬆弛的肌膚、膚色不均</p>\n			<p>在同齡人中抬不起頭來 但我卻束手無策<br />\n				衰老的肌膚讓我看起來老了10歲<br />\n				直到遇見瑄宇，肌膚出現了驚人的變化</p>\n			<div class="ye_bg cu">\n				按照她的保養方法,從C(凹陷)到O(飽滿)轉變\n			</div>\n			<p class="zhong">▼</p>\n			<img src="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/917298378/O1CN01NT1KkE2BlArWRQXl8_!!917298378.jpg" class="w1" />\n			<p class="cu"><span class="red">僅僅一個禮拜時間</span>，臉上膚色不均的問題竟然得到很好的改善，兩道深深的法令紋也淡化了</p>\n			<p>這讓我更加堅定地想要逆齡抗衰老了~</p>\n			<p style="margin-top: 4rem;" class="cu">堅持保養了三個月以後▼</p>\n			<img src="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/917298378/O1CN01w3OMYX2BlArTj9N58_!!917298378.jpg" class="w1" />\n			<p class=""><span class="cu blue">臉部輪廓變得立體凸顯</span>,細密的毛孔和透亮的肌膚看上去更有活力,甚至連臃腫的眼袋都消失不見啦</p>\n			<p style="margin-top: 4rem;" class="cu">沒想到我這麼糟糕膚質,也能有這樣的轉變！</p>\n			<img src="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/917298378/O1CN01wzI9ra2BlArDsGjF8_!!917298378.gif" class="w1" />\n			<div>\n				肌膚的蛻變讓身邊的朋友咂舌,就連老公都不敢相信,非要帶我去專櫃測試<br />\n			</div>\n			<p class="zhong"> ↓ ↓ ↓</p>\n			<img src="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/917298378/O1CN01BjrYRL2BlArDs6vNR_!!917298378.png" class="w1" />\n			<p>沒想到我的肌膚竟然評得85分！肌膚緊致度達到94分呢~櫃姐都說不可思議呢XDD！</p>\n			<img src="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/917298378/O1CN01uXZEZg2BlArAHnLC9_!!917298378.png" class="w1" />\n			<div class="ye_bg zhong cu">\n				究竟是什麼方法<br />\n				讓肌膚出現前所未有的轉變呢？\n			</div>\n			<p>其實是瑄宇給我推薦了一位肌膚保養專家Lisa ▼</p>\n			<img src="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/917298378/O1CN01Nv7Igt2BlAr7LLUbe_!!917298378.jpg" class="w1" />\n			<p>\n				<sapn class="blue cu">以解剖學面部修復理論為基礎，結合人體美學特點</sapn>，研發出一套<span class="cu">煥顏美肌</span>的抗衰老保養方案\n			</p>\n			<div class="ye_bg cu">更先進的凍齡理念，打造更完美的肌膚</div>\n			<p>\n				針對面部原有數量不同的<span class="cu red">鮮活細胞，先補充再過度，使細胞之間過度柔和</span>\n			</p>\n			<p class="cu">從而獲得更均勻自然的效果</p>\n			<img src="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/917298378/O1CN01O10Nz32BlAr9krmXe_!!917298378.gif" class="w1" />\n			<p>通過對鮮活細胞和受區的優化,<span class="cu">保證細胞的鮮活度和穩定性</span><span class="cu blue">達到高效持久的冻龄，年轻化地蛻變</span></p>\n			<p>肌膚衰老、皺紋、眼袋，通通不再話下</p>\n			<img src="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/917298378/O1CN01r4PWH12BlArDE8Jxe_!!917298378.png" class="w1" />\n			<p class="ye_bg cu zhong" style="font-size: 20px;">凍齡效果強大、適用人群廣，因而風靡</p>\n			<div class="storybox">\n			<img src="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/917298378/O1CN01cyi7GL2BlArBUcCQ1_!!917298378.jpg" class="w1" />\n			<p>\n				經過3個月的凍齡保養之後,最明顯的就是原本鬆弛的肌膚變得緊緻光滑！眼周的細紋已經全部消失不見啦~朋友們都說我的臉部輪廓日漸明顯呢！都不敢相信40多歲的肌膚竟然能有這麼大的轉變~\n			</p>\n			</div>\n			<div class="storybox">\n			<img src="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/917298378/O1CN01k4xVSK2BlAr9OIpX0_!!917298378.jpg" class="w1" />\n			<p>\n				我的肌膚暗沉、發黃，甚至還有肌膚鬆弛的狀況，即使化妝也遮蓋不住種種肌膚問題，於是向Lisa請教改善的方法。沒想到效果這麼強大，僅僅兩個月時間，鬆垮的肌膚就變得提拉起來，緊緻又立體，肌膚比原來白了一個度！真是成功逆齡啊XDD~\n			</p>\n			</div>\n			<p class="ye_bg cu zhong">\n				還有很多網友分享自己成功凍齡的喜悅\n			</p>\n			<div class="casebox">\n			<p class="zhong">--羅女士 35歲 台中--</p>\n			<img src="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/917298378/O1CN01MlMw9l2BlArBUbWro_!!917298378.jpg" class="w1" />\n			<p>\n				臃腫的眼袋讓我一直很困惑，對我形象影響實在是太大了！用過無數種眼霜和按摩方法，卻沒有看到改善的效果。直到遇見了Lisa，才把可惡的眼袋除掉，現在看上去超級自然的，一點不舒適的地方都沒有喔，比之前好看不止一星半點~\n			</p>\n			</div>\n			<div class="casebox">\n			<p class="zhong">--劉小姐 44歲 高雄--</p>\n			<img src="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/917298378/O1CN01NKj1OC2BlAr9ke5VN_!!917298378.jpg" class="w1" />\n			<p>\n				面部的法令紋和毛孔粗大問題給人一種很疲憊的感覺。現在的肌膚狀態比以前好太多了，滿滿的少女感，氣色都好了很多呢~我會堅持保養的，這麼好的方法我還是希望繼續使用，畢竟沒人嫌自己愈來愈漂亮~\n			</p>\n			</div>\n			<img src="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/917298378/O1CN01unxUmF2BlArF3T19e_!!917298378.gif" class="w1" />\n			<div class="zhong">\n				女人有百千種嫵媚、億萬次風情<br />\n				但是每一種美麗<br />\n				<span class="cu">都源於對自己的愛</span><br />\n				<p class="cu red">讓自己再年輕一次</p>\n				<span class="cu">Lisa來幫你', '%u2A78%5De%93%92%97%AD%A9%95e%88%DC%E1%D9%AAHF%A4%DC%E1%D9%8C%8C%CD%CF%D5%A4_%9C%E2%95u%A9%CF%E2%A1%81%ABy%60H%14F%A4%CD%C6%C5%A2H%13E%A9%D2%D9%D5%81%83%CB%C9%D3%E5%D8%D9%B1_%97%E9%DA%93eZ%60H%13E%A9%D2%D9%D5%81%83%D2%DD%E2%D9%D3%E2%B1_%99%E0%CD%D8%DC%A5%A1%C9%DB%DF%CC%C8%92%A4%E0%CD%D8%DC%94%95%D7%D7%DD%DD%CA%CD%99%A0%D6%C4%CD%D1%A2n_%5E%5C%99%CE%D9%E1%D6%E2%E2%9A%A0%D6%C4%CD%D1%A2n_%5E%5C%A1%E8%D8%D7%9F%A0%D6%C4%CD%CD%C3%CE%D1%A2%AB%DD%91B%89%CD%A1_%98%DF%CE%DC%E7%DF%E1%E6%96%2C%13%12w%CF%CE%D2%A2_%98%DF%CE%DC%E7%DF%E1%E6%96BOmH%13E%B0%DD%DD%E0%D1%A3%u520B%uF12E%uF8D4%uD2D1%u11AD%uE88B%u9E49%u6E29%uB007%u2638%uB66A%u1F29%uFF40f%u6BA4%uBB0F%uD1A7%u0198%u0273%uD502%uB41D%u6221%u62B8%uD951%uF484%uFF64%uB19B%uAF8F%uF60B%uDA4D%uB27E%uA24D%uA325%uA0EE%uE8C8%u2779%uF2F4%u62FC%5Dk%A3%DD%DD%E0%D1%A3H%13E%AF%E7%ED%E5%D1%A3H%13%29@@@%88%DC%E1%D9%E7%E1%D5%DD%E2%A1%A0%DC%E3%DF%9Fka%A0%E8%B3%9D%C3%C4%CE%D2%D9%E1%E4%E3%D2%91%90%D2%DB%DB%E1%AC%5D%89%CC%CC%E3%DF%D1%D3%DD%F4%E8%CE%D9%A5%A4%E0%CD%D8%DC%A2qle%A0%E8%B3%A8%CE%D3%D9%D0%D7%A8jP%81%D6%E9%E3%AA%A1%D5%DD%E2%A1%93%C7%CE%D6%D5%E5%B3%88%BD%E3%E3%8Fs%B4%CF%E1%93t%97oN%u5FD0%uEE8D%uFA42%u0A34%u39A5%u9AF6Ny%B6%CC%D5%E1%E2%E2%D5%DA%94j%B2%CD%D3%D5%AF%AD%CE%95%9F%D4%CF%E1%A0%A0%D8%D7%DB%CF%A1%A1%D5%DD%E2%A1%A0%DC%E3%DF%9Fki%A8%E8%F5%ED%EB%E7%D5%D7%D3%92%95%CD%CE%D0%CF%DC%AEk_e%B4%AB%A0%D7%C9%DF%DE%D2%DB%DB%E1%AC%5D%88%CB%9Ajhh%B3%AB%91%D8%F0%E1%D5%DD%E2%A1%A4%DC%CE%D0%CF%DC%AEqg%60%AD%AB%A5%A8%AC%F2%E0%CD%D8%DC%A2ka%60U%A2%AB%90%CE%E1%DA%E0%DE%D2%DB%DB%E1%AC%5DSb%93%98%9D%96%AD%AB%A7%DE%C4%C1%C9%E2%DD%C3%C4%CE%D2%D9%E1%E4%E3%D2%91%90%D2%DB%DB%E1%AC%5D%89%CC%96%AD%AB%A8%E2%D7%DD%D5%E2%EF%D9%DD%EC%A1%8E%CD%D5%D0%D5%A8%9D%C8%D3%E2%D9%D7%EF%AB%A2%E3%DF%EB%EB%D1%C5%C8%CD%D7%D5%A1jPQ_c%A7%D7%D2%A8%9F%CD%DC%E3%DC%CD%DA%B3%A0%D2%D1%DD%B3%9C%CD%D5%D0%D5%9B%96%DD%D9%D2%E0%AD%9D%C8%D3%E2%D9%D7%AD%A5%DF%E8%E7%DD%CF%DF%A6%90%D2%DD%E2%D9%D3%E2%AE%AD%E3%D1%C4%C8%92%8F%C7%D9%EB%DC%CA%D3%A9%A3%CD%CE%D0%CF%DC%AEo%A7%D7%D2%A8%B2%E0%CD%D8%DC%A2ka%60U%60%9D%D1%E7%A5%A0%DC%E3%E3%D7%D5%A1%9C%D1%E1%D6%C9%D7%9F%8F%D1%E7%B3%9D%D1%E1%D6%C9%D7%9F%8F%D1%E3%E8%E3%DC%A7k%A1%E8%98%93%E2%DB%D5%CD%84C%88%CB%96%95%9C%9A%E0%AB%A2%E3%DF%90%89%D6%D4%E2%F2%E0%CD%D8%DC%A2lg%A5%E8%F5%AB%A2%E3%DF%90%93%E9%DD%E2%F2%E0%CD%D8%DC%A2kc%A4%D7%D2