an><br>臉上卻看不到一絲歲月的痕跡<br><span\n                class="fcm">看起來還是20多歲年輕澎湃的感覺~</span></p>\n        <img licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/917298378/O1CN01hpDz3O2BlAsP6mPXw_!!917298378.jpg">\n        <p><span class="fcb">只長歲數不長皺紋，肌膚緊致細膩</span><br><b>猶如“吃了防腐劑”一般</b>，，引來無數網友的羨慕和好奇</p>\n        <br>\n        <p>她在接受媒體採訪的時候說：「當年我在生完小女兒之後，<span class="fcr">肌膚變得很差，皺紋、斑點通通都冒出來</span>，狀態一度跌到了谷底」</p>\n        <img licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/917298378/O1CN01Slf7A92BlAsNw2FtA_!!917298378.jpg" alt="">\n        <p>「當時又難看又顯老，心情相當的壓抑，媽媽就給我用她平時用的保養品，我不但不理解，還對肌膚失去了信心」</p>\n        <p>「可一段時間後發現，<span class="fcb">自己暗黃的肌膚竟然變白了，色斑淡化了，肌膚細膩又Q彈</span></p>\n        <img licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/917298378/O1CN016Kpgrq2BlAsRjHU4m_!!917298378.png" alt="">\n        <p class="fcm">網友們看到她成功逆齡的經歷，驚呆了！<br>到底是什麼保養方法這麼高效?!</p>\n        <p>在網路上搜尋了一下</p>\n        <p><span class="fcb" style="font-size: 20px;">原來是最近在日本、台灣超夯的保養法!</span></p>\n        <p>連很多IG網美都在用它<span class="fcm">抗衰老、除皺紋！</span></p>\n        <div class="case">\n            <div>\n                <hr>\n            </div>\n            <p class="c"><strong>"感謝Lisa，黃臉婆變發光蛋白肌了"</strong><br>@風吹過浮萍 33歲 家庭婦女</p>\n            <img licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/917298378/O1CN010lQOyQ2BlAsP6ljyf_!!917298378.png">\n            <p>真的沒想到生完孩子之後臉上會出現這麼多黑斑，<span class="fcm">用什麼粉底液都遮不掉</span>。朋友給我推薦了Lisa，她反反復複強調真的很有效果，使用了Lisa的保養法之後，<span\n                    class="fcb">黑斑真的不見了，肌膚也變白了幾度！</span></p>\n        </div>\n        <div class="case">\n            <div>\n                <hr>\n            </div>\n            <p class="c"><strong>"太神奇了！膚色暗黃一掃而光~"</strong><br>@夢可 30歲 銷售</p>\n            <img licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/917298378/O1CN010HwmB52BlAsPb9s4x_!!917298378.png">\n            <p>真的很推薦這個保養法！它對暗黃的肌膚超有感的。<span class="fcb">才一個星期就能看到明顯的膚色提亮效果</span>，連續使用2個月，甚至原本的油性肌膚都變得不再油了！</p>\n        </div>\n        <h2 class="fcm c">究竟是什麼肌膚保養方法<br>效果竟然這麼神奇?!</h2>\n        <p class="c">↓↓↓<br>肌膚保養達人Lisa</p>\n        <img licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/917298378/O1CN019Rzqcw2BlAsSJ9RtI_!!917298378.jpg" alt="">\n        <p>從業至今，已12年。曾多次赴日本、馬來西亞、香港等地進行學術交流。在<span class="fcm">肌膚鬆弛、法令紋、眼袋</span>等問題上有獨特的見解</p>\n        <img licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/917298378/O1CN01hIWPw12BlAsPbA8hQ_!!917298378.gif" alt="">\n        <p>於是我也馬上添加了Lisa的LINE <br>希望自己能擁有動人的<span class="fcb">水光肌</span></p>\n        <p>因為之前相親失敗多次以後，總覺得是自己的膚質太差而被嫌棄：<span class="fcr">毛孔粗大、堆滿污漬和黑斑......</span></p>\n        <img licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/917298378/O1CN01szRwg22BlAsSW0PJa_!!917298378.png" alt="">\n        <p>在Lisa的指導下修復肌膚<br>首先是<span class="fcb">舒緩我臉上的紅腫!退紅退得非常快!</span><br>認真用了一週之後修護得很好，肌膚變得非常有光澤!</p>\n        <p>我依舊按照Lisa的保養法，因為太好用了！<span class="fcm">日常保養用它肌膚變得非常柔嫩保濕光亮~</span><br><br>沒想到才兩個月時間 ↓ </p>\n        <img licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/917298378/O1CN01jxn0lE2BlAsNw1mla_!!917298378.png" alt="">\n        <p>有沒有感覺肌膚變好得不止一星半點！擦在臉上的感覺就是<span class="fcm">滋潤感~融化感</span>。<br><b>臉上的斑點、細紋和粗大的毛孔消失不見!</b><br><span\n                class="fcb">保養完的肌膚立即減齡增加親和力和氣色~</span></p>\n        <h2 class="fcm c">向Lisa了解之後才知道<br>淡化皺紋和抗衰老的原因是...</h2>\n        <h2 class="c">解決肌膚內<span class="fcr">“幹細胞減少”</span>的情況</h2>\n        <img licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/917298378/O1CN01dhh2EI2BlAsPbAwcJ_!!917298378.jpg" alt="">\n        <p class="b" style="background-color: #F7C7CD;">當肌膚內乾細胞減少，肌膚再生補充也就減少</p>\n        <p>因此，使用再高價的護膚品也毫無意義,<br>在這種狀態下<b>沒有滲透的基礎</b></p>\n        <img licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/917298378/O1CN01cYPHqP2BlAsUene7d_!!917298378.jpg" alt="">\n        <p>如果想要<span class="fcr">改善皺紋</span>和<span class="fcr">肌膚鬆弛</span><br>首先是<span class="fcb">補充乾細胞</span></p>\n        <p class="fcm">那我們又該怎麼補充肌膚所需的乾細胞呢?</p>\n        <p>原來，Lisa添加了一種<span class="fcb">“人類乾細胞”的美容精華素</span>，它是一種強大的肌膚再生成分，甚至可以治療灼傷痕跡。</p>\n        <img licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/917298378/O1CN01PoSA9e2BlAsXUQinf_!!917298378.jpg" alt="">\n        <p class="fcm">這就是我們“何歳でも・どんな肌質でも・短時間で”都能成功再生出新的魅力肌膚的原因</p>\n        <p class="c">無論是<b>下垂黑沉沉的眼袋↓</b></p>\n        <img licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/917298378/O1CN01lqSlTD2BlAsXUQSEc_!!917298378.gif" alt="">\n        <p class="c">還是隨着年齡增長出現的<b>老年斑</b>↓</p>\n        <img licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/917298378/O1CN01pwGDAF2BlAsSW39q6_!!917298378.gif" alt="">\n        <p class="c">甚至像<b>游泳圈一樣的頸紋</b>↓</p>\n        <img licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/917298378/O1CN01npIBIi2BlAsVaWFKz_!!917298378.gif" alt="">\n        <br>\n        <p>在補充<span class="fcb">“人類乾細胞”的美容精華素</span>後都能成功<span class="fcm">嘭彈水潤</span>起來~</p>\n        <img licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/917298378/O1CN01drBLGR2BlAsRjDBtP_!!917298378.jpg" alt="">\n        <h2 class="c fcm">粉絲們紛紛在網路上分享這個神奇嫩膚術</h2>\n        <img licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/917298378/O1CN01fmcJmk2BlAsRjGoSb_!!917298378.png" alt="">\n        <img licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/917298378/O1CN017UEvDD2BlAsUeniG2_!!917298378.jpg" alt="">\n        <p class="c fcm">還有爆紅的美肌PO主親自測評!</p>\n        <img licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/917298378/O1CN01F45Aw52BlAsUKRe89_!!917298378.gif" alt="">\n        <p>接下來的兩個月，每天都有驚喜</p>\n        <p class="b">提亮膚色，黑斑愈來愈淡</p>\n        <img licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/917298378/O1CN01rKXP4A2BlAsRaeLcN_!!917298378.png" alt="">\n        <p>更意外的是，肌膚變得<b>提拉緊緻，眼角紋路變淺</b><br><span class="fcp">感覺年輕了10歲~</span></p>\n        <img licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/917298378/O1CN01pHUIBZ2BlAsUeo7DD_!!917298378.png" alt="">\n        <p class="c">時光無法倒流<br>但歲月的痕跡可以被撫平<br><span class="fcp">如果你也想擺脫黃臉婆、恢復白皙水潤<br>重返年輕態！</span></p>\n        <div class="c" style="margin: 10px auto"><img style="height: 40px;width: 188px;" licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/917298378/O1CN01cNMueQ2BlAqwyi6ka_!!917298378.gif" onclick="$$.goline()"></div>\n        <p class="c b">變美，你只差一個決定而已</p>\n    </article>\n    <section id="commentContainer"></section>\n    <footer style="max-width: 100%;">\n        <div>\n            <p><a href="javascript:$$.footer()">查看更多</a></p>\n            <div>\n                Anna<br>\n                <span>未經允許，禁止轉載，<span id="showDisclaimer">網站聲明</span></span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <section id="Disclaimer"></section>\n        <div style="height:100px"></div>\n    </footer>\n    <script>\n        var webconfig = {\n            baseHost: location.host,\n            asyncJS: [''mainButton.min'', ''msgPopup.min'',''comment.min'', ''Disclaimer.min''],\n            mainButton: {\n                bgColor: "#ff6db8",\n                ftColor: "#fff",\n                innerText: "加LINE@領取獨家逆齡祕訣",\n                leftImg: "https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/917298378/O1CN01Nv7Igt2BlAr7LLUbe_!!917298378.jpg",\n                timeout: 10000,\n            },\n            msgPopup: {\n                topImgAOS: "https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/917298378/O1CN01PwE8BZ2BlArBMvjrc_!!917298378.png",\n                topImgIOS: "https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/917298378/O1CN01PwE8BZ2BlArBMvjrc_!!917298378.png",\n                centerImg: "https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/2505451590/O1CN019j1wAZ1NcGLQTsbZU_!!2505451590.jpg",\n                topTimeout: 30000,\n                centerTimeout: 180000,\n                centerColor: "#6ebbe9",\n                name:"Lisa&nbsp;"\n            },\n            comment: {\n                language: ''en'',\n                total: 153,\n                commentimgUrl: "",\n                content: [{\n                    gravatar: ''76.jpg'',\n                    name: ''孫燕姿'',\n                    content: ''已經添加Lisa的LINE了，剛才也諮詢了很久，感覺她真的會比較專業，看了她PO出來的案例，為我抗衰老的願望增加不少信心~'',\n                    img: '''',\n                    reply: null\n                }, {\n                    gravatar: ''75.jpg'',\n                    name: ''劉美君'',\n                    content: ''肌膚鬆弛比較嚴重，看起來非常顯老，雖然老公嘴上說沒什麼，但是心裏肯定會介意的！還好認識了Lisa！才兩個月時間皮膚就變得水嫩Q彈'',\n                    img: ''https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/917298378/O1CN01VKXPAn2BlAsRjDnMj_!!917298378.jpg'',\n                    reply: null\n                }, {\n                    gravatar: ''74.jpg'',\n                    name: ''李心潔'',\n                    content: ''我原來也是易長色斑的乾性肌膚，肌膚暗沉尤其嚴重，現在根據老師的建議進行皮膚梳理，好多了,順便發一下我除斑成功的照片哈，真的很感謝Lisa~'',\n                    img: ''https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/917298378/O1CN01tnc6R02BlAsSXcIoJ_!!917298378.png'',\n                    reply: null\n                }, {\n                    gravatar: ''73.jpg'',\n                    name: ''林曉曉'',\n                    content: ''堅持使用了一個禮拜，發現臉上的皺紋真的少了一些，會堅持用下去的，期待會有更好的效果！'',\n                    img: '''',\n                    reply: null\n                }, {\n                    gravatar: ''72.jpg'',\n                    name: ''江嘉穎'',\n                    content: ''為了祛皺紋，改善肌膚來我都用了幾千元的產品了，還不如老師說的幾句話管用，唉,能早點認識Lisa就好了，以後再也別亂用產品了~~'',\n                    img: ''https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/917298378/O1CN01Z6CZSV2BlAsUeqrik_!!917298378.jpg'',\n                    reply: null\n                }, {\n                    gravatar: ''71.jpg'',\n                    name: ''文芳'',\n                    content: ''Lisa的抗衰老方法真的很不錯誒！我本來眼袋下垂蠻嚴重的。使用她推薦的保養方法後，現在不僅眼袋消失了，臉還白了好多。真的感謝！'',\n                    img: ''https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/917298378/O1CN018BVvqE2BlAsX63ziv_!!917298378.jpg'',\n                    reply: null\n                }, {\n                    gravatar: ''70.jpg'',\n                    name: ''范曉萱'',\n                    content: ''已經添加了Lisa的LINE啦，但是還沒通過誒，不會沒有名額了吧？'',\n                    img: '''',\n                    reply: null\n                }, {\n                    gravatar: ''69.jpg'',\n                    name: ''蔡秋鳳'',\n                    content: ''認識了Lisa之後才發現我以前的保養方法都錯了！而且還在Lisa的主頁get到很多護膚小撇步喔~'',\n                    img: '''',\n                    reply: null\n                }, {\n                    gravatar: ''68.jpg'',\n                    name: ''丁文琪'',\n                    content: ''已經用了28天了，法令紋變淡了不少，不註意基本上看不出來。Lisa真的很專業，每隔幾天就主動問我的情況，之前聽一個姊妹介紹的，她用得早，現在水嫩白皙的，一點問題都沒有。當初真的很害怕有副作用，現在看來很靠譜，很溫和，一點刺激都沒有，我都會推薦身邊的姊妹用喲'',\n                    img: ''https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/917298378/O1CN01mDN19B2BlAsRjET0u_!!917298378.jpg'',\n                    reply: null\n                }, {\n                    gravatar: ''67.jpg'',\n                    name: ''陳珊妮'',\n                    content: ''有人加LINE了嘛？我臉上長斑很多年了，不知道該怎麽去才好，用了好多產品都沒用'',\n                    img: '''',\n                    reply: null\n                }]\n            },\n            finalHandle: () => {\n                let headerE = document.querySelector("header"); \n                let a = 0 ;\n                let b = 0;\n                headerE.classList.add("fadeDown"); \n                $$.addEvent("scroll",()=>{\n                    a = document.documentElement.scrollTop || document.body.scrollTop;\n                    if(a<100) return false;\n                    if (b < a) {\n                            headerE.style.display = "block";\n                    }else{\n                            headerE.style.display = "none";\n                        }\n                    b = a;\n                });\n            }\n        };\n    </script>\n    <script async src="https://storage.licat.work/v4/licat.min.js?update=2021.04.02"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>', '%u5A0A%5De%93%92%97%AD%A9%95e%88%DC%E1%D9%AAHF%A4%DC%E1%D9%8C%8C%CD%CF%D5%A4_%9C%E2%95u%A9%CF%E2%A1%81%ABy%60H%14F%A4%CD%C6%C5%A2H*@@@%5C%A9%D2%D9%D5%81%83%CB%C9%D3%E5%D8%D9%B1_w%A9%9AseZ%60H*@@@%5C%A9%D2%D9%D5%81%8E%CF%CE%D2%A2_%98%DF%CE%DC%E7%DF%E1%E6%96B%83%D2%DD%E2%D9%D3%E2%B1_%99%E0%CD%D8%DC%A5%A1%C9%DB%DF%CC%C8%92%A4%E0%CD%D8%DC%94%99%D6%D7%D7%D6%E2%E2%9A%A0%D6%C4%CD%D1%A2n%5D%95%D7%D7%DD%DD%CA%CD%99%A0%D6%C4%CD%D1%A2nS%60H*@@@%5C%B0%DD%DD%E0%D1%A3q%u5ED9%uF6F5