(13, 1, '2021-04-02', '张国钦', 'B', '近看沒毛孔、膚色白到像日光燈！44歲的我只用了這個方法就讓斑點消失無蹤！', 'https://licat.work/storage/topic/20210402/b86a944a1df5eba3f7c35570aa10cb42.', '在跑中的，成本一般，但能用', 1, '<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang="zh-Hant-TW">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset="UTF-8">\n    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0,minimum-scale=1">\n    <title>近看沒毛孔、膚色白到像日光燈！44歲的我只用了這個方法就讓斑點消失無蹤！</title>\n    <link rel="shortcut icon" href="https://storage.licat.work/favicon/woman.ico">\n    <style>\n        footer>div {\n            text-align: center;\n            padding: 0;\n            margin: 0\n        }\n\n        footer>div>p {\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #cdcdcd;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 10px 0\n        }\n\n        footer>div>p>a {\n            color: #4267b2;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            text-decoration: none\n        }\n\n        footer>div>div>span {\n            font-size: .8em\n        }\n\n        footer>div>div .footerlogo {\n            margin-top: 4px;\n            height: 25px;\n            margin-bottom: -6px\n        }\n\n        mark {\n            color: red\n        }\n\n        .chatimgbox {\n            padding: 20px 12px 12px;\n            background-color: #ff9ca0;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n\n        .comments {\n            padding: 0 !important;\n        }\n\n        #addlinebutton {\n            left: 0 !important;\n        }\n\n        @media screen and (max-width:767px) {\n            .comments span {\n                font-size: 16px !important;\n            }\n\n            .acomment_tool span {\n                font-size: 12px !important;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media screen and (min-width:768px) {\n            .comments span {\n                font-size: 20px !important;\n            }\n\n            .acomment_tool span {\n                font-size: 16px !important;\n            }\n        }\n\