le>\n    <script async src="https://storage.licat.work/v4/licat.min.js?update=2020.12.11"></script>\n</head>\n\n<body>\n    <header id="wmheaderContainer">\n        <div class="comm_header">\n            <div class="comm_header_top">\n                <div class="comm_header_logo"><img\n                        src="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/2505451590/O1CN018OPEWf1NcGLQSlOKR_!!2505451590.png">\n                </div>\n                <div class="comm_header_list">\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><embed src="https://storage.licat.work/icon/mo_icon_list1.svg" type="image/svg+xml" /></li>\n                        <li><embed src="https://storage.licat.work/icon/mo_icon_list2.svg" type="image/svg+xml" /></li>\n                        <li><embed src="https://storage.licat.work/icon/mo_icon_list3.svg" type="image/svg+xml" /></li>\n                        <li><embed src="https://storage.licat.work/icon/mo_icon_list 4.svg" type="image/svg+xml" /></li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class="comm_header_nav" id="headermenu">\n                <div class="comm_header_nav_menu">\n                    <ul>\n                        <li>達人</li>\n                        <li class="active">漂亮</li>\n                        <li>瘦身</li>\n                        <li>感情</li>\n                        <li>風尚</li>\n                        <li>星事</li>\n                        <li>電視</li>\n                        <li>最美話題</li>\n                        <li>購物</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class="comm_header_nav fixedmenu fadeDown" id="headermenuf">\n                <div class="comm_header_nav_menu">\n                    <ul>\n                        <li class="active">漂亮</li>\n                        <li>瘦身</li>\n                        <li>感情</li>\n                        <li>風尚</li>\n                        <li>星事</li>\n                        <li>電視</li>\n                        <li>最美話題</li>\n                        <li>購物</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class="comm_title">\n            <h1>【超實用】沒想到這個小方法，竟然能「美白除斑」，分享給想要除斑的妳</h1>\n        </div>\n        <div class="comm_status">\n            <div class="comm_time">\n                <p><span class="color3 l_icon">漂亮</span><span class="color5">By 李心蕊</span><br><span class="color5"\n                        id="releaseDate"></span><span class="color5">&nbsp;15:33</span></p>\n            </div>\n            <div class="comm_object">\n                <ul>\n                    <li><a><embed src="https://storage.licat.work/icon/appicon1.svg" type="image/svg+xml" /></a></li>\n                    <li><a><embed src="https://storage.licat.work/icon/appicon2.svg" type="image/svg+xml" /></a></li>\n                    <li><a><embed src="https://storage.licat.work/svg/appicon3.svg" type="image/svg+xml" /></a></li>\n                    <li><a><embed src="https://storage.licat.work/icon/appicon4.svg" type="image/svg+xml" /></a></li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n    <article class="article_content">\n        <p class="xvyan"><strong>“太不可思議了，臉上的斑這次竟然超輕易就去掉了！”當時，張露還有點不太相信自己臉上8年的斑點，只用了32天就徹底修復的事實</strong></p>\n        <p class="center" style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong style="font-size: larger;">祛斑前</strong></p>\n        <img class="article_firstimg"\n            licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/917298378/O1CN01gKgQU42BlAudmgouN_!!917298378.png">\n        <p></p>\n        <p>張露今年28歲，從2013年開始發現臉上開始長斑，這8年裏斑點越來越嚴重，膚色也變得非常暗黃。為了祛斑，張露用過無數的方法，去美容院、購買昂貴的護膚品、使用偏方等等，但是最終都沒能去掉，既浪費了時間，更浪費了不少錢。那段日子裏，張露慢慢失去祛斑的信心，甚至連生活都變得自卑起來，直到....\n        </p>\n        <p class="center" style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong style="font-size: larger;">成功祛斑後</strong></p>\n        <img class="article_img"\n            licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/917298378/O1CN01n7edJP2BlAudFkWVL_!!917298378.png">\n        <p>就在2021年2月，張露看到一則官方的新聞報道:<span style="color:red">研究12年了!終於發現 能徹底去掉臉上色斑的植物成分</span>，通過下麵官方聯繫方式找到了這種神奇的透明液</p>\n        <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);">&nbsp;現在就來加LINE體驗</span></p>\n        <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);">快速領取消除斑點的好方法！</span></p>\n\n        <div style="width: 100%;text-align: center;"><img onclick="$$.goline()" style="width: 200px;"\n                src="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/917298378/O1CN01sF7q1x2BlAudLTBh4_!!917298378.gif"></div>\n\n        <div\n            style="max-width:96%;margin:0px auto 0px auto;height:100px;line-height:30px;height:auto; overflow:hidden;padding:0px 7px 0px 7px; margin-top:9px; overflow:hidden;text-indent:1.5em;">\n            <p>在專人指導下使用，神奇的事開始了：</p>\n            <p><b style="font-weight:bold">第2天</b>，驚訝！洗臉時候發現洗出了小量褐色的“髒東西”，感覺水嫩舒服了一些</p>\n            <p><b style="font-weight:bold">第3天</b>，斑點明顯變淡了，暗黃問題改善</p>\n            <p><b style="font-weight:bold">第5天</b>，斑點只剩隱約可見，皮膚白了2個度</p>\n            <p><b style="font-weight:bold">第15天</b>，斑點基本全部消失，皮膚恢復白皙、細膩、有光澤…….老師建議堅持使用</p>\n            <p><b\n                    style="font-weight:bold">第28天</b>張露去做了一次專業的肌膚檢查，通過所有的檢查結果分析，確認了她的色斑問題已徹底解決，並且不存在復發的可能性！美容師說：“這簡直就像給肌膚做了一次大掃除，色素和雜質痘統統清除掉了，潔白、光滑細膩，看上去至少年輕了5歲，效果太好了！”\n            </p>\n            <img licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/917298378/O1CN01Tdz4rq2BlAuemP9ax_!!917298378.jpg" alt="">\n\n            <p style="text-align:center;font-weight:bold">自祛斑成功後，顏值擔當的張露終於被生活善待，重獲了自信，感覺人生處處充滿希望</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class="center" style="margin-bottom: 5px;">神奇的天然植物透明液</p>\n        <img licat-url="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/917298378/O1CN01RPB7HK2BlAufvynvp_!!917298378.jpg">\n\n        <p><b style="font-weight:bold;font-size:17pt">神秘透明液的神奇之處：</b></p>\n\n        <p>透明液的祛斑效果如此神奇，主要依靠活性超高的“去黑因數”，促進皮膚裏黑色素迅和其他雜質的迅速分解和脫落，等於是給肌膚進行了一次高效大掃除！被清理過的皮膚，看上去就好像新生嬰兒的皮膚一樣潔白無瑕，同時還解決了痘痘、皮膚粗糙等一系列的問題\n        </p>\n        <p><span style="color:red;font-weight:700;">神奇透明液適用於所有色斑</span>：雀斑、黑斑、黃褐斑和老年斑等</p>\n        <div style="text-align:center">\n            <video autoplay="" loop="" muted="" x5-video-player-fullscreen="true" x5-playsinline="" playsinline=""\n                webkit-playsinline="" width="100%" height="auto"\n                poster="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/2684310334/O1CN01aR20yb1EL0pqx9Y6G_!!2684310334.jpg">\n                <source src="https://cloud.video.taobao.com//play/u/917298378/p/1/e/6/t/1/306590834139.mp4"\n                    type="video/mp4">\n                <div fallback="">\n                    <p>This browser does not support the video element.</p>\n                </div>\n            </video>\n        </div>\n        <p><span\n                style="font-weight:600">本文結語：科學家十多年的研究，終於創造出這種神奇的透明液，目前在使用的31000例個案中，成功率高達99%以上。2021年的今天終於可以宣告色斑問題徹底攻破</span>\n        </p>\n        <p class="center"><span style="font-weight:600">想快速解决色斑问题，添加官方line</span></p>\n            <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);">&nbsp;現在就來加LINE體驗</span></p>\n            <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);">快速領取消除斑點的好方法！</span></p>\n        <div style="width: 100%;text-align: center;"> <img style="width: 200px;" src="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/917298378/O1CN01sF7q1x2BlAudLTBh4_!!917298378.gif"></div>\n        <br>\n        <br>\n        <br>\n        <br>\n        <p>\n            <a href="javascript:location.href=''https://social-plugins.line.me/lineit/share?url=''+location.href;"\n                class="heartshare" target="_blank">❤愛心接力，點擊分享給需要幫助的LINE好友</a>\n            <br><a href="javascript:;" onclick="$$.goline()"><span\n                    style="color:#008000;">加我LINE好友！私聊女人我最美熱門話題</span></a></p>\n\n        <div class="article_keywords">\n            <div class="article_keywords_list">\n                <ul>\n                    <li>保養</li>\n                    <li>除斑</li>\n                    <li>美白</li>\n                    <li>漂亮</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </article>\n\n    <section id="commentContainer"></section>\n    <footer>\n        <div>\n            <p><a href="javascript:$$.footer()">查看更多</a></p>\n            <div>\n                <img class="footerlogo"\n                    src="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/2505451590/O1CN018OPEWf1NcGLQSlOKR_!!2505451590.png"\n                    style="height: 25px;width: 84px;"><br>\n                <span>未經允許，禁止轉載</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style="height:50px"></div>\n    </footer>\n    <section style="display:none;position:fixed;bottom:0;left:0;width:100%;text-align:center;z-index: 99;">\n        <div style="width:100%;max-width:650px;margin:0 auto;height:auto;overflow:hidden;">\n            <img onclick="$$.goline()"\n                src="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/917298378/O1CN01EDCSwa2BlAuSIr7uG_!!917298378.jpg"\n                style="width:100%;max-width:650px;height:auto;margin:0;">\n        </div>\n    </section>\n    <script>\n        var webconfig = {\n            baseHost: location.host,\n            syncJS: [],\n            asyncJS: [''comment.min'', ''mainButton.min'', ''msgPopup.min''],\n            mainButton: {\n                bgColor: "#ff9398",\n                ftColor: "#fff",\n                innerText: "立即領取獨家美白除斑祕笈",\n                leftImg: "https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/917298378/O1CN01Su4K112BlAqorDkFr_!!917298378.jpg",\n                timeout: 10000,\n            },\n            msgPopup: {\n                topImgAOS: "https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/917298378/O1CN01AvzEaJ2BlAs24Uzd2_!!917298378.png",\n                topImgIOS: "https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/917298378/O1CN01AvzEaJ2BlAs24Uzd2_!!917298378.png",\n                centerImg: "https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/917298378/O1CN01Su4K112BlAqorDkFr_!!917298378.jpg",\n                name: "Anna老師",\